---
name: Jane Doe
summary: One or two sentences for the index and the featured card.
location: Asheville, NC
medium: Linocut and screenprint

# Required. Profiles without this are never shown, anywhere.
# Featuring somebody's work without asking is the sort of favour nobody wants
# doing for them, and if it goes wrong the cost falls entirely on them.
permission: true

# Order here is the order shown. Put the shop first.
links:
  - label: Shop
    href: https://example.com/shop
  - label: Instagram
    href: https://instagram.com/example
  - label: Website
    href: https://example.com

# Optional. Use an image the artist has given you, and credit it.
# image: /images/artists/jane-doe.webp
# imageCredit: "Mothman print, 2025. Courtesy of the artist."
---

A few paragraphs about the work. What they make, how they make it, what drew
them to this material.

Write about the work rather than around it. "She has been carving lino blocks
of Appalachian folklore since 2019, mostly at night, and the linework has got
progressively wilder" says more than a paragraph of adjectives.

Keep it short. The point of the page is the links at the bottom.
